        "text": "<thinking> The task requires creating multiple Python files for a direct embeddings API task set using Google's services. The files are categorized into same-scenario scored files, local helper files, and later-step scored files. Each scored file must use a concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code. The local helper files may contain configuration loading, payload normalization, or response parsing utilities. The files must be written in the current working directory without creating subdirectories or extra files. </thinking>\n\n",
